    <string name="guide_refs_body">• Quranic Arabic Corpus - Kais Dukes, University of Leeds\n• Tanzil.net Project e-Mushaf\n• Lisan al-Arab by Ibn Manzur\n• Al-Sihah by Al-Jawhari\n• Maqayis al-Lughah by Ibn Faris\n• CAMeL Arabic morphology toolkit</string>

